      "category": "Text",
      "text": "(h) This request would then customarily be referred by the Board of Estimate to the City Planning Commission, the Director of Real Estate and the Director of the Budget. It is assumed that with these steps accomplished, the Commission will usually be able to certify that the site is in conformity with the Master Plan, and no further public hearing will be necessary. The site, upon its acquisition, will be a part of the Master Plan, and the remainder of the adopted area will no longer be part of the Plan.",
