    {
      "bbox": [
        944,
        1372,
        2067,
        1625
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "604. At least three identical posters, not less than 8\u00bd by 11 inches in size, describing the proposed change and stating that all persons interested in the change will be notified of the date fixed by the Commission for a public hearing on the matter, provided they file written requests for such notice with the Secretary to the Commission must be conspicuously exhibited for at least one week within one month prior to the submission of the petition. These posters must be placed not more than 200 feet apart along the entire length of the frontages sought to be changed and on any streets in the rear less than 300 feet distant therefrom. A copy of this poster must be submitted with the petition.",
      "logprob_stats": {
